# Local MQTT secrets (do not commit)
**/MqttSecrets.local.h
**/MqttSecrets.local.cpp

# Built firmware images. A .bin embeds whatever MqttSecrets.local.cpp held at
# build time, so every one of these is a copy of the device private key. 2,514 of
# them were sitting untracked-but-not-ignored on 2026-08-20, i.e. one `git add -A`
# away from the same leak that already happened via Sense_Minimal.ino.
**/dist/
**/artifacts/*.bin
*.ino.bin

# Tool runtime data. Contains presigned S3 URLs (access key id + signature in the
# query string) captured from live runs -- expiring, but not source.
tools/live_monitor/data.json
tools/soak_dashboard/gallery.json

# Session Board runtime state (never commit — .session_board_secret is the
# internet-facing auth token; the others are local caches)
.session_board_secret
.session_board_names.json
.session_board_summaries.json
.session_board_positions.json
